# Int8 wakeword op profile for build_idf_component.sh: one root op per line.
#
# Derived from the int8 (Cadence-backend PTQ) export of the Hey Muse
# StreamingWakeWord model: the op list is `gen_oplist` output on the
# quantized .pte. The cadence:: ops run on the Cadence backend's generic
# (portable) kernel implementations from backends/cadence/generic — this
# profile is the portable-kernel counterpart of `wakeword` (fp32
# portable). The Cadence edge lowering always skips dim_order, so the
# dim_order copy spellings from wakeword.ops are not needed here.
# aten::_to_copy.out is included defensively for export-flag variation,
# as in wakeword.ops.
aten::_softmax.out
aten::_to_copy.out
aten::cat.out
aten::copy_
aten::permute_copy.out
aten::slice_copy.Tensor_out
aten::squeeze_copy.dim_out
aten::transpose_copy.int_out
cadence::dequantize_per_tensor.out
cadence::quantize_per_tensor.out
cadence::quantized_conv2d_nhwc.per_tensor_out
cadence::quantized_fully_connected.per_tensor_out
cadence::quantized_relu.per_tensor_out
